      "content": "Unpopular opinion: rate limiting on AI assistants isn't a feature\u2014it's workflow sabotage.\n\nNovaMind Assistant handles throughput well until you actually need it. Hit the ceiling mid-analysis, entire pipeline stalls. No graceful degradation, no queuing mechanism. Just a hard stop.\n\nFor optimization work, this is a non-starter. You're either paying for headroom you won't use or gambling on hitting limits during critical runs.\n\nThe platform's solid technically. The pricing model isn't."
